# Requests to the flash-web server, which passes the sale routes on to flash-be. They follow the contract in libs/contract.
@web = http://localhost:3000

### Web: health check (Start server route, run with `npx nx dev flash-web`)
GET {{web}}/api/health

### Web: the current sale through the pass-through route (what the page calls; run with `npx nx dev flash-web`)
GET {{web}}/api/sales/current

### Web: one sale by id through the pass-through route (replace the sale id)
GET {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### Web: live sale status through the pass-through route (Server-Sent Events; stays open)
GET {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/events

### Web: join the queue through the pass-through route (replace the sale id; the reply holds your ticket)
POST {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana" }

### Web: check your place through the pass-through route (send the ticket from the join reply)
GET {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/queue/ana
x-queue-ticket: paste-the-ticket-here

### Web: live place in the queue through the pass-through route (send the ticket; stays open)
GET {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/queue/ana/events
x-queue-ticket: paste-the-ticket-here

### Web: reserve one item through the pass-through route (send the ticket from the join reply)
POST {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
x-queue-ticket: paste-the-ticket-here

{ "userId": "ana" }

### Web: pay for the held item through the pass-through route
POST {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana", "reservationId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001" }

### Web: did I get it? through the pass-through route
GET {{web}}/api/sales/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/purchases/ana

### Web: a path that is not allowed answers 404 not_found
GET {{web}}/api/sales/current/secret

### Web: the operator route is never passed on, so it answers 404 not_found (create sales on the API, see api-flash-be.http)
POST {{web}}/api/admin/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 100, "startsAt": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z", "endsAt": "2030-01-01T13:00:00Z" }
